Arara Code: opt in to the upstream esbuild packaging pipeline on macOS.

Why a patch: extension APIs cannot configure the compiler that builds the host.
The build environment selects the existing upstream pipeline without changing
runtime behavior or the default compiler on other platforms.
Touches: build/buildConfig.ts

--- a/build/buildConfig.ts
+++ b/build/buildConfig.ts
@@ -12 +12 @@
-export const useEsbuildTranspile = false;
+export const useEsbuildTranspile = process.env['ARARA_MACOS_ESBUILD'] === '1';
